{'symbol': 'GNRC', 'date': '2022-08-25 09:01:00', 'title': 'GENERAC POWER SYSTEMS ADDS NORM TAFFE AS PRESIDENT - ENERGY TECHNOLOGY', 'text': 'TAFFE BRINGS THIRTY YEARS OF LEADERSHIP AND CLEAN ENERGY TECHNOLOGY EXPERIENCE WAUKESHA, WIS. , AUG. 25, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- GENERAC POWER SYSTEMS , A LEADING GLOBAL DESIGNER, MANUFACTURER AND PROVIDER OF ENERGY TECHNOLOGY SOLUTIONS AND OTHER POWER PRODUCTS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT NORM TAFFE HAS JOINED THE COMPANY IN A NEWLY CREATED POSITION OF PRESIDENT – ENERGY TECHNOLOGY.'}